{"id":"w453113","name":"Gobi Bhagi (Spiced Cauliflower Stew)","author":"Wikibooks Cookbook contributors","source":{"name":"Wikibooks Cookbook","url":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook:Gobi_Bhagi_(Spiced_Cauliflower_Stew)"},"via":{"name":"Wikibooks","url":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook:Gobi_Bhagi_(Spiced_Cauliflower_Stew)"},"image":"","cuisine":"","country":"","region":"Global","course":"main","protein":"veggie","diet":3,"allergens":802816,"minutes":40,"time":{"prep":30,"cook":10,"passive":0,"passiveWhy":[]},"timeEstimated":true,"servings":"","difficulty":"medium","ingredients":[{"item":"300 g cauliflower","qty":""},{"item":"Vegetable oil","qty":""},{"item":"100–150 g finely-chopped onions","qty":""},{"item":"4–5 average-size tomatoes, chopped","qty":""},{"item":"3–4 pieces finely-chopped green chiles","qty":""},{"item":"Finely-chopped ginger","qty":""},{"item":"1 tbsp red chile powder","qty":""},{"item":"Finely-chopped coriander leaves","qty":""},{"item":"1 tbsp garam masala","qty":""},{"item":"1 tbsp pepper","qty":""},{"item":"Salt to taste","qty":""}],"steps":["Boil the cauliflower in hot water for 5 minutes. Drain and cut into big pieces.","Heat some oil in a pan, and add the onions. Add the tomatoes, and fry until the tomatoes leave the oil.","Add the cauliflower, green chiles, ginger, chili powder, and some water. Pressure cook for 6–7 minutes.","Stir in garam masala, pepper, and salt.","Serve with chappati or naan and pulao."],"tags":[],"youtube":"","culture":null,"license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","lifestyle":79,"era":"modern"}